    "description": "Settling velocities of the suspended sediment in the Kongsfjorden waters were obtained using owen tubes. Several measurements were achieved using different types of suspended sediment (Kogsfjorden waters, Bayelva plume, Goule Plume, Bayelva river, Goule river...), several concentrations and several air temperatures.",
